      "review_summary": "The PR adds a first-message and session-store non-cron guard to `buildSessionEntry` text-pattern cron fallback, plus a mid-transcript archive regression test.\n\nPR surface: Source +12, Tests +30. Total +42 across 2 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. Source inspection shows current main can clear or skip reset/deleted archive content after a user-role `[cron:]` prefix on usage-counted archive paths; the PR’s newest guard also has a source-level regression path against the existing direct cron-archive opacity test.",
